function watchHot(){const e=$('#hs');if(!e||typeof IntersectionObserver=='undefined')return;if(!HIO)HIO=new IntersectionObserver(es=>{if(es[0].isIntersecting&&V=='home'&&T=='ht')hotMore()},{rootMargin:'500px'});HIO.disconnect();HIO.observe(e)}
const hotCard=(h,i)=>{const hu=safeUrl(h.u);return`<article class="card hot"><div class="cw"><div class="av hk">${esc(h.k[0])}</div><div class="bdy"><div class="hd"><b>${esc(h.k)}</b><span class="tag">Hot</span></div>${h.t?`<p><b>${esc(h.t)}</b></p>`:''}${h.x?`<p>${esc(h.x)}</p>`:''}${h.s?`<div class="mu sm">${esc(h.s)}</div>`:''}${h.i?`<img loading="lazy" src="${esc(h.i)}" alt="">`:''}${h.o?h.o.map((o,j)=>`<button class="opt ${h.p==null?'':o==h.c?'ok':h.p==j?'no':''}" data-a="tans" data-id="${i}:${j}">${esc(o)}</button>`).join(''):''}${hu?`<a class="lnk sm" href="${esc(hu)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">${h.k=='Tech news'?'Read article':'Read more'}</a>`:''}</div></div></article>`};
